264
00:33:07.882 --> 00:33:10.151
David! David!

265
00:33:36.275 --> 00:33:37.877
Target's on the move.

266
00:33:41.179 --> 00:33:43.412
All subjects, target is heading
west towards Fifth Street.

267
00:33:43.414 --> 00:33:45.715
